# Everything under data/ is verified byte-for-byte against SHA-256 manifests, so git must never
# rewrite it on checkout. Without this, a clone with core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default)
# converts the JSON samples to CRLF and the integrity tests fail on a repository that is correct.
data/** -text

# The raw-input manifests record hashes of files that must not be rewritten either.
*.json -text
